    "title": "Intermittent CI failure in wallet_send.py, in , line 329, in run_test                                        assert_fee_amount(fee, count_bytes(res[\"hex\"]), Decimal(\"0.00002\")),                                    AssertionError: Fee of 0.00000438 BTC too high! (Should be 0.00000432 BTC)",
    "body": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/actions/runs/36761522744/job/110045003745?pr=36340#step:11:8289\r\n\r\n```\r\n test  2026-09-30T18:59:19.594725Z TestFramework (ERROR): Unexpected exception: \r\n                                   Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n                                     File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/test_framework.py\", line 145, in main\r\n                                       self.run_test()\r\n                                     File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/build_ ₿🧪_/test/functional/wallet_send.py\", line 329, in run_test\r\n                                       assert_fee_amount(fee, count_bytes(res[\"hex\"]), Decimal(\"0.00002\"))\r\n                                     File \"/home/runner/work/_temp/test/functional/test_framework/util.py\", line 69, in assert_fee_amount\r\n                                       raise AssertionError(\"Fee of %s BTC too high! (Should be %s BTC)\" % (str(fee), str(target_fee)))\r\n                                   AssertionError: Fee of 0.00000438 BTC too high! (Should be 0.00000432 BTC)\r\n```\r\n\r\n_Originally posted by @maflcko in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/36340#issuecomment-5919101375_\r\n            ",
