      "created_at": "2026-10-02T06:53:19Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-02T06:53:19Z",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "The signature in this run was 3 bytes shorter than the 71 bytes the wallet assumes, because of leading zeros in r or s (about 1 in 4 million). The wallet paid for 219 vbytes (`Fee:438 Bytes:219` in the node log) and the transaction was 216, one byte more than `assert_fee_amount` allows. #36408 raises the allowance to 3 bytes.\n",
